{"id":10000056,"name":"九条裟罗","enName":"Kujou Sara","title":"黑羽鸣镝","element":"雷","region":"稻妻","rarity":4,"weapon":"弓","birthday":"7月14日","constellation":"羽团扇座","description":"「天领奉行」的大将，杀伐果断，骁勇善战。","affiliation":"天领奉行","cv":{"chinese":"杨梦露","japanese":"濑户麻沙美","english":"珍妮·迪拉多","korean":"文支映"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000056-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000056-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/11-500/Sara.zip","voicePackageEn":"Sara","quoteCount":74,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"我的名字是九条裟罗，你记不住也无妨，只需知道：我将永远护卫稻妻、践行鸣神的意志，不论神鬼，遇敌必除！呼…别紧张，既然答应与你并肩，我自当尽心尽职。大义外的事情，我不会计较的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_draw_appear","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d0/ex1j3kh9xsvk18m4mfs2ff0mk0lpu8i.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·正鹄","desc":"只有保持心、弓、箭三位一体，才能命中正鹄。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/98/ql9j8v8hquceu5nefdx5qtvd7rtou68.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·永恒","desc":"为将军大人实现「永恒」，这就是我的「愿望」。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3d/n5bzcai5q52bjphlg1p3co3f2afp829.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·使命","desc":"天狗的职责是护佑山林，九条家的使命是守卫稻妻，两者并无二致。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b2/7x640xu7f3umoizwavze0sebdcup77z.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"雨滴的声音会掩盖脚步声，多加注意吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9d/t4u57xwsq713k45fbi2z7s9vpsgeoaf.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"听见了吗？鸣雷正是将军大人的意志。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7b/00d7teqqyxehv5o8gi9xz2r7eajnrvk.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"想要留住雪花。但在手心里，它只会融化得更快。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d7/b6nb4ur8zpnv03djgwf843ta0szsy00.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"天清气朗，适合演武。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b6/loaezxza1mnpbcml79rr67xul7ajvtf.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早上吗？对于我而言，这已经不早了。通常我睁开眼时，天还没亮。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ad/o27tog9gqrua483n74lk6n60sz94ssw.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"我没有午休的习惯，但如果你想，我可以等你。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cb/oxq2o5hbwbnij6z4unm2e8m2gzludq1.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"晚上好。随口一提，花见坂的夜樱，是不可多得的景致。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1d/3jjnf2vjto2bshzjv8f7dvqc0fdthfn.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"去休息吧，这里有我看着就行。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6b/1gmoohc583vptndl7yf5b0jus0rzxnx.mp3"},{"title":"关于裟罗自己·天领奉行","desc":"家主于我有恩，「天领奉行」是我唯一的依靠，我会倾尽一切来捍卫家族的荣誉。嗯？你问「天领奉行」的行事准则？那自然是忠于雷电将军大人，这也是我九条裟罗此生唯一的信条。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9d/hls3n9k0ggdx0rx7y8zoto33uc4hbti.mp3"},{"title":"关于裟罗自己·备战","desc":"「准备好了吗？」如果在出发前，你有这样确认的习惯。十次中，恐怕只有一次，你能听到我的答复。其余九次，我已经化身利刃，身处前线。这并非蛮勇或不忠，而是战场从来不会留给人喘息的时间。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/df/hnnkn6zb4phru0xs8sv074sedfe3sik.mp3"},{"title":"关于裟罗自己·愿望","desc":"我的愿望？我原以为你早已知道，辅佐将军大人实现「永恒」就是我的愿望。嗯？为自己所想的愿望？这种东西，我没有想过…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5d/8yneg1ezx7oh7sc5nmgdpdhv4vssear.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·观察","desc":"虽然你对于将军大人的「永恒」而言是个「不安定」的因素，但「不安定」也未必代表「阻碍」。我不会与你为敌，但，我会一直盯着你。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/86/rlzxxz29sb8pqfd5t97e5f548mowcu5.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·体会","desc":"收缴神之眼时，我漠视了人们的愿望。在眼狩令已然结束的当下，我有责任作出弥补。听说你能听见千手百眼神像上那些神之眼蕴含的愿望？请跟我好好讲讲吧。还有…也跟我说说你的愿望吧，我想知道。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_close2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5e/6z8pev38jvssbqu2ed7xmdmk60zuiol.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"得到神明的注视，才能获得「神之眼」。既然我的「神之眼」是由将军大人所赐，最后，我也会将它还给将军大人，不怨不悔。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/mzcoisrijy484fpjq97cxarwnx8qur3.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享·陀螺","desc":"上次执行任务时，花见坂的商户送给我一个名为「独乐」的陀螺，那是种「一个人也能玩」的玩具，我觉得挺有意思，就留在了身边。你说…一起玩？那岂不是违背了「独乐」的原则，请容我拒绝。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1c/qf405gae15grnavci2kydqcwxzrtq89.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享·特产","desc":"知道稻妻最具代表性的特产是什么吗？不对，并非刀具。是「御建鸣神主尊大御所大人像」造型的漆器，由老练的漆器师傅手工打造，城内几乎每家每户都供奉着一座。我的屋里？有五座。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_share_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ea/3kbj8iwq7czkm8b5efemrn5w8ky49rt.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"当我心中有难解之事时，我会伫立在神樱树下闭目养神，再次睁开眼时，飘落的花瓣就会为我指引方向。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_pref_gift","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/83/7ly35d8sp921f6yevss2xajkii8h6fc.mp3"},{"title":"关于托马…","desc":"「天领奉行」的宅邸很大，如果有像托马一样优秀的家政官就好了，一定能将家中纷繁事务打理妥当。要是什么时候，他不再想侍奉神里家了，我很希望他能过来帮忙。不过大概不会有这一天吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_teammate_thoma_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/62/9v01cvbn33fpvfxhhd4rjav4zwbeygx.mp3"},{"title":"关于神里绫华…","desc":"平时在九条家，只有士兵们在道场训练的声响，而每次路过神里家，总会听见舞乐声、打闹声和笑声。听闻神里家的大小姐棋技了得，我一直等候时机，想要登门拜访，却又担心…像我这般严肃的人，是否会与那般氛围格格不入呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_teammate_ayaka_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/da/67579n8kgjagussnlhbqgfxa5sxp9h2.mp3"},{"title":"关于宵宫…","desc":"只要她不在我的军营里乱放烟花，我是不会找她麻烦的。哼，我知道，抛开别的不谈，她做的烟花的确流光溢彩，值得称赞。只不过烟花易逝，刹那光辉结束后，夜空上留下的依旧是黑暗。所以我时常提醒自己，想要贯彻护佑稻妻的使命，就不能沉沦在这些虚幻的光景中。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_teammate_yoimiya_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/ff/5azz6j1pdol94emrisz3fdlcvtpkk0d.mp3"},{"title":"关于鹿野院平藏…","desc":"鹿野院…虽说这位是我的同僚，但我对他没什么好感。总感觉他有很多自己的盘算，没有把组织的事放在第一位。要不是看在他探案有功的份上，早该对他多加管束。\n唉，真是头疼。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_teammate_heizou_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/aa/qvadc6kl4kxb54tenu6gqar00cjgh62.mp3"},{"title":"关于雷电将军·相信","desc":"你肯定从不少地方听说过吧？将军大人追求的是无念无执的永恒，舍弃尘世的执念，执着不变的永恒。将军大人的言行决断，我并非每一处都能参透。但既然这是她的决定，我便相信她。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_teammate_raidenShogun_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b9/ar33b8ldfc824m3sqkv9z9u3pkn1hvf.mp3"},{"title":"关于雷电将军·追随","desc":"「眼狩令」废除…嗯，看来你才是对的。咳…但这并不说明将军大人是错的。只是追求「永恒」之路的方式将要改变罢了。不知那位千百年来守护着稻妻的将军大人，如今心中是否平静呢。我只知道，不管道路上有多少险阻，我都会一如既往追随她。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_teammate_raidenShogun_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/93/e0rx3pbofqyodwii0v174kuaodeog8h.mp3"},{"title":"关于八重神子…","desc":"八重宫司大人的所作所为，经常会让我产生误会…但她既然贵为鸣神大社的大巫女，不难得见将军大人对她的信任与默许，我自然也会敬重她。不过，如果哪天她做了忤逆将军意志的事情，那就恕我冒犯了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_teammate_yaeMiko_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fb/gl4cmgwbskaeou6ledyscm7jg73ol1d.mp3"},{"title":"关于珊瑚宫心海…","desc":"比起「巫女」，她作为「军师」的才能更高。用锦囊打仗，此前实属闻所未闻。我是否也该学习着用这种方法来指挥幕府军呢？嗯…但这样恐怕会演变成双方把锦囊摆上台面，像卡牌一样逐张对战…想想还是不妥。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_teammate_kokomi_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/rg2f3nrjfg8hur142ovhg1gx5rqpvhu.mp3"},{"title":"关于五郎…","desc":"他之于珊瑚宫心海，正如我之于将军大人。同为坚守忠义之人，我很欣赏他。只可惜立场不同，注定没办法同行。但有这样值得敬佩的对手，还不赖。而且，「五郎」…可是个好名字。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_teammate_gorou_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6b/cf42dh6kz2x38c40kxv4p3oux8c5f5s.mp3"},{"title":"关于荒泷一斗…","desc":"…说起这位，难免有些头疼。收缴他的神之眼时闹了不少动静，是我见过最聒噪的人…不，最聒噪的鬼。能堂堂正正认输算是有点男子气概，只不过他的复仇之约实在是…到此为止，我不想说了。你如果实在想知道，还是自己去问他吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_teammate_itto_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/40/anlnvr28el41acuqmaa6t6tuluju9sy.mp3"},{"title":"关于久岐忍…","desc":"以她的才华和资质，留在那个名为「荒泷派」的组织实在有点可惜。但不得不说，有她在，至少有效地阻止了闲散人士滋事扰民，减轻了天领奉行的负担。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_teammate_shinobu_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2f/ox682pdcdw51n7t9bs7kl0qnlimt304.mp3"},{"title":"关于绮良良…","desc":"近来总觉得暗处有奇怪的视线，待我确认时又消失无踪。真是不明所以的恶作剧。你说…是只猫又？嗯…既然有事找我，堂堂正正报上名来就行。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_teammate_kirara_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fb/ndcxf923u12h9iianfdsccbczw3kec2.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解裟罗·其一","desc":"了解我…请问是指什么？天领奉行的各项事务均为机密，将军大人的事情更是无可奉告，我不明白你有什么意图。嗯？了解我本身？倒也并非不可，只是…从未遇过这种情况。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/aps5hhfx3qj9w6ubl7buhjwcjr7sifc.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解裟罗·其二","desc":"我的生活还算简单，不用领队战斗时，我会准时在凌晨五点零五分起床，在庭院做五组深呼吸后走五圈，早饭习惯吃五口米饭…「五」是能为我带来幸运与胜利的数字，所以我会一直坚持「五」，请问你有什么异议吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3c/fb4m3e56yhevd2tqr31khvhbbrh05tl.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解裟罗·其三","desc":"执行眼狩令的过程中，最令我感到棘手的，是那些顶着幕府军头衔动用私刑的官兵。将军大人的任务固然要坚定执行，但我决不允许他们滥伤无辜！我已经三申五令禁止这种行为，就结果而言…依然难以杜绝。你若是有什么好办法，还望赐教。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1c/25zsz51ajrp5gzny4vne1232ybhz0t1.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解裟罗·其四","desc":"虽然名义上是九条家的养子，但孝行大人看我的眼神，与看镰治时的不同。即使木讷如我，也会偶感寂寞，尤其…在看到部下与亲人相见的温暖场面后。\n抱歉，家主于我有恩，原是不该说这种大不敬的话的…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/56/ijpb0c3oua5hsbnt39jcgpfi26qgpnl.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解裟罗·其五","desc":"现在回想起来，你我也算「不打不相识」。我们一度处于对立面，说势不两立也不为过，真没想到现在竟然能这样并肩而行，促膝长谈。这样想来，我还真是得到了命运的眷顾…不，没什么。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6c/mf0o4dusui62cyuw7r18sgr7rpmmb47.mp3"},{"title":"裟罗的爱好…","desc":"即使到了现在，素引练习和草靶练习依然是我每天必不可少的训练项目。从身法到瞄准再到听弦，绝不是枯燥的重复，而是对昨日的突破。与其说是爱好，不如说是一生的修行。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_pref_hobby_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ce/izb4toptye92zu7rtsk14c3t2i6k5d1.mp3"},{"title":"裟罗的烦恼…","desc":"天狗的翅膀是固有的客观存在，并排站的话肯定会占据一定的空间，我不明白你说的「拉近距离」究竟要怎么实现。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ce/49vmkq11uz9ai0u1gr8l9dp9przvr88.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"长久以来，我已经习惯吃饭团之类方便携带、能够迅速饱腹的食物了，这也是战场上恢复体力的首选。不过，这只是个人习惯，我不会要求部下跟我一样。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/59/qaa7or7xfk7ygfkbxt98t4vczam6z2x.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"没有厌恶一说，只是我平日会避免吃甜食。问我原因吗？甜食会使人身心放松，一旦吃了就容易…呃，总之，我不能懈怠，话题到此结束，不要再追问了！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7e/ie5clj03m392h6psv867bbinm1z5mtd.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"比饭团更美味的食物…值得记下它的名字。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/8jspvi2ku90xeyvddaquv3l82miyzdd.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"我吃饱了。多谢款待。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/30/753hf3791wcyt1wmw2ixsm1d4rmuhjj.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"甜点还是不必了…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2b/hctka5tt3ctywip47vli93qugl0xdie.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"来得正好，那我就免去礼节，直接问了。有什么生日愿望吗？只要不与将军大人的大义相悖，我都会竭尽全力帮你完成。为表诚意，今天你可以许五个生日愿望。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_pref_birthday","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/10/t989288xkb06g6p1o0zdmo1evfkfuhu.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"满意的弦音，看我一击即中。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/49/5yvs0q2g30o3i8h2v80s1y4jzi22460.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"力量已经融入我体内，随时听命。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/34/a50jxhsjie29kda38k99qlrmv0x3ijn.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"我一个人，就是一支幕府军！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/psmt96e86heqrrva3shej2bzzltwxoz.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"磨炼自身，突破武艺，本是我的职责所在，但你却倾尽心力相助…我不会辜负这份力量，定将其用于大义！还有，天狗的情谊，与你同在！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/86/0ru25krb40qqjeos0in0sk6kp01en17.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"羽移！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c3/oz4phzdmxedw5ed97synwqb7kp0gt6i.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"散！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bd/aqr53piummr6jvgn3sszcz47ek732p9.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"雷闪！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/41/rvnr9e29nnlj1wm46l71ghx57wjyxfc.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"常道恢弘，鸣神永恒！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f7/16eftq4e4t7ml1s3wjkf6ghz69v5vus.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"落雷…不悔！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/57/fc4dt1zs7040wd2blj56i7nl50d0z3j.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"雷光千道！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6c/hwth08ayk3848f3sdfj6zmnjqakw6zz.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"不错的宝物，能够提振士气！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0a/1154sgt9499mf42w6wbl3n3pt25ltrf.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"很好，没有放过任何角落。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/11/irm3ikx3x9jo313ltzyns0tpkvecao9.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"补充完就上路吧！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4f/l6e1lxjom80dcb3xredflx9qxfsomlz.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"我会坚持到底…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/17la2wsx46u34wm7y754jqp9yl2gl50.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"必须寻找突破点！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d5/nyugjhahpfm6mr8750hip8yxcamq8y4.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"快到极限了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6a/4840gtvzzwyjqjlhwvpnorpojvi8gi1.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"不要勉强！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/64/59qb0b9ox19ejk20ef9b7hmy5vhaifu.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"退下！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/66/rxjr6s9jf7ixyeoj6u6x20hqp7cs6fh.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"生命终非永恒。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2b/du0tlw2yxod4ix2vn3cap32ol4qhku1.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"我绝无怨言…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/ddzowxeccz9gryverw44c4gq8m920od.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"哼，是我败了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d1/czd25r1tfs64d70fv6jw4jlb5v4s3hx.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"再来！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_battle_hit_L_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/aa/33h4myxt0zur4ipewmr7rk0z0pnjk43.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其二","desc":"不错的对手…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_battle_hit_L_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/09/neleh9i9fze2m6jfz08584x0sxjxjdq.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"怎么会！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ce/2fu7bpo9nrs7n5zp3mnk1cyiin9qs4u.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"战况不顺…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_kujouSara/vo_kujouSara_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/16/q7dnstgtzc1z4rbkcw8fm6cw757invv.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"我会带领你获得胜利。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_kujouSara_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fb/mbdt64tarv5y9k08vgzpzki4qm6wpyz.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"哼，来吧。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_kujouSara_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/58/38kgnqip6ka1pzyaxqmxd8vtg1348g0.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"与你并肩！","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_kujouSara_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/76/fw1o9ymxze6cm3zjr9m04sgtw46dh5x.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000056-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000056-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1019,"fullArtHeight":862}